message: "If you use SwasthyaSanjaal, the Nepali Clinical Lexicon, or NepClinBench in your academic research, please cite this work as follows."
title: "SwasthyaSanjaal: A Nepali Clinical Language Layer for Structured Health Information"
abstract: "A clinical NLP conversion layer for transforming handwritten prescriptions, Devanagari documents, Romanized notes, code-mixed Nepali-English text, and community health assessments into structured, reviewable, and interoperable HL7 FHIR R4 clinical records."
